               The tool prints the edSignature and length values to paste below.

            3. Copy this <item> block, fill in the new version details and upload
               the .zip + updated appcast.xml to your server.
        -->

        <item>
            <title>Version 1.2.1</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:26:28 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description
            ><![CDATA[
                <h3>Fixes</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>The stopwatch panel no longer keeps showing "The Internet connection appears to be offline" once you are back online. The message clears with the next refresh.</li>
                </ul>
